# Receipts, ledgers and tests hash sources, protocols, logs and retained results byte for byte,
# across the library, the tests and the benchmarks: every text file is checked out with LF
# line endings, whatever core.autocrlf says.
* text=auto eol=lf
# The attention chambers' archived sources are named by the SHA-256 of their bytes: no line
# ending of theirs is converted, at checkout or at commit.
benchmarks/attention/results/sources/*.txt -text
